{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ8spinuhQA8j4GwLJ5W","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01GsegarzSx69BkXeReqmYR1","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-012-oWrFuJ/index.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\">\n  <title>静息瑜伽 · 课程价格</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"静息瑜伽工作室课程价格：单次课、10 次卡、月卡、年卡，找到适合你的练习节奏。\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<header class=\"site-header\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a class=\"logo\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"logo-mark\">🪷</span>静息瑜伽</a>\n    <nav aria-label=\"主导航\">\n      <a href=\"#\">首页</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">课程表</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" aria-current=\"page\">价格</a>\n      <a href=\"#faq\">常见问题</a>\n    </nav>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main>\n  <section class=\"hero wrap\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">课程价格</span>\n    <h1>找到适合你的练习节奏</h1>\n    <p>无论是偶尔放松，还是坚持日常练习，都有合适的方案。所有会员卡均可预约全部团课类型，首次到店免费体验一节。</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"wrap plans\" aria-label=\"价格方案\">\n    <article class=\"plan\">\n      <h2>单次课</h2>\n      <p class=\"desc\">适合初次体验或时间不固定的你</p>\n      <div class=\"price\"><span class=\"currency\">¥</span><span class=\"amount\">150</span><span class=\"unit\">/ 次</span></div>\n      <p class=\"per\">&nbsp;</p>\n      <ul class=\"features\">\n        <li>任选一节 60–75 分钟团课</li>\n        <li>提供瑜伽垫与辅具</li>\n        <li>可使用淋浴与更衣室</li>\n        <li class=\"off\">免费私教体态评估</li>\n        <li class=\"off\">会员活动与工作坊优惠</li>\n      </ul>\n      <button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" data-plan=\"单次课\">立即预约</button>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"plan\">\n      <h2>10 次卡</h2>\n      <p class=\"desc\">灵活安排，每周 1–2 次练习的理想选择</p>\n      <div class=\"price\"><span class=\"currency\">¥</span><span class=\"amount\">1,280</span><span class=\"unit\">/ 10 次</span></div>\n      <p class=\"per\">折合 ¥128 / 次<s>¥1,500</s></p>\n      <ul class=\"features\">\n        <li>10 节团课，3 个月内有效</li>\n        <li>提供瑜伽垫与辅具</li>\n        <li>可使用淋浴与更衣室</li>\n        <li>可分享给家人朋友使用</li>\n        <li class=\"off\">免费私教体态评估</li>\n      </ul>\n      <button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" data-plan=\"10 次卡\">购买次卡</button>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"plan featured\">\n      <span class=\"badge\">最受欢迎</span>\n      <h2>月卡</h2>\n      <p class=\"desc\">30 天不限次数，帮你养成练习习惯</p>\n      <div class=\"price\"><span class=\"currency\">¥</span><span class=\"amount\">899</span><span class=\"unit\">/ 月</span></div>\n      <p class=\"per\">每周练 3 次，折合约 ¥70 / 次</p>\n      <ul class=\"features\">\n        <li>30 天内团课不限次数</li>\n        <li>可提前 7 天优先预约</li>\n        <li>提供瑜伽垫、辅具与毛巾</li>\n        <li>1 次免费私教体态评估</li>\n        <li>工作坊 9 折优惠</li>\n      </ul>\n      <button class=\"btn primary\" type=\"button\" data-plan=\"月卡\">开通月卡</button>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"plan\">\n      <h2>年卡</h2>\n      <p class=\"desc\">长期练习者的最优之选，全年无忧</p>\n      <div class=\"price\"><span class=\"currency\">¥</span><span class=\"amount\">6,999</span><span class=\"unit\">/ 年</span></div>\n      <p class=\"per\">折合 ¥583 / 月，省 35%<s>¥10,788</s></p>\n      <ul class=\"features\">\n        <li>365 天团课不限次数</li>\n        <li>可提前 14 天优先预约</li>\n        <li>赠送 2 节一对一私教课</li>\n        <li>每年可停卡 30 天</li>\n        <li>工作坊 8 折 + 专属储物柜</li>\n      </ul>\n      <button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" data-plan=\"年卡\">开通年卡</button>\n    </article>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <h2 class=\"title\">方案对比</h2>\n      <p class=\"sub\">一张表看清每种方案的区别</p>\n      <div class=\"table-scroll\">\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr>\n              <th scope=\"col\">权益</th>\n              <th scope=\"col\">单次课</th>\n              <th scope=\"col\">10 次卡</th>\n              <th scope=\"col\" class=\"col-featured\">月卡</th>\n              <th scope=\"col\">年卡</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td>价格</td><td>¥150</td><td>¥1,280</td><td class=\"col-featured\">¥899</td><td>¥6,999</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>可上课次数</td><td>1 次</td><td>10 次</td><td class=\"col-featured\">不限</td><td>不限</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>有效期</td><td>当天</td><td>3 个月</td><td class=\"col-featured\">30 天</td><td>365 天</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>提前预约</td><td>3 天</td><td>3 天</td><td class=\"col-featured\">7 天</td><td>14 天</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>可转赠 / 共享</td><td class=\"no\">—</td><td class=\"yes\">✓</td><td class=\"col-featured no\">—</td><td class=\"no\">—</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>停卡</td><td class=\"no\">—</td><td class=\"no\">—</td><td class=\"col-featured\">7 天</td><td>30 天</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>私教课</td><td class=\"no\">—</td><td class=\"no\">—</td><td class=\"col-featured\">体态评估 1 次</td><td>2 节一对一</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>工作坊优惠</td><td class=\"no\">—</td><td class=\"no\">—</td><td class=\"col-featured\">9 折</td><td>8 折</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <h2 class=\"title\">所有方案均包含</h2>\n      <p class=\"sub\">在静息，每一次练习都安心舒适</p>\n      <div class=\"notes\">\n        <div class=\"note\"><div class=\"icon\">🧘</div><h3>全部团课类型</h3><p>哈他、流瑜伽、阴瑜伽、普拉提、冥想与孕产瑜伽。</p></div>\n        <div class=\"note\"><div class=\"icon\">👩‍🏫</div><h3>认证导师</h3><p>导师均持有 RYT-200 及以上认证，小班教学，每班不超过 15 人。</p></div>\n        <div class=\"note\"><div class=\"icon\">🌿</div><h3>干净的空间</h3><p>每节课后消毒瑜伽垫，新风系统全天运行。</p></div>\n        <div class=\"note\"><div class=\"icon\">📱</div><h3>线上预约</h3><p>小程序随时约课，开课前 2 小时可免费取消。</p></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"faq\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <h2 class=\"title\">常见问题</h2>\n      <p class=\"sub\">还有疑问？欢迎随时到前台或致电咨询</p>\n      <div class=\"faq\">\n        <details open>\n          <summary>我是零基础，可以来上课吗？</summary>\n          <p>当然可以。课程表中标注「入门」的课程专为零基础学员设计，首次到店还可以免费体验一节，导师会根据你的身体状况给出建议。</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>10 次卡过期了还能用吗？</summary>\n          <p>10 次卡自首次使用起 3 个月内有效。到期前可申请一次延期 1 个月，到期后剩余次数无法继续使用。</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>月卡和年卡可以停卡吗？</summary>\n          <p>可以。月卡每期可停卡 7 天，年卡每年累计可停卡 30 天，出差、生病或怀孕等情况可凭证明额外申请。</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>可以从次卡升级为月卡或年卡吗？</summary>\n          <p>可以。在次卡有效期内升级，未使用次数按 ¥128 / 次折算抵扣新卡费用。</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>购买后可以退款吗？</summary>\n          <p>购卡 7 天内且未使用可全额退款；已使用的会员卡按实际使用情况扣除费用后退还余额，具体以门店会员协议为准。</p>\n        </details>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"cta\">\n      <h2>还在犹豫？先来体验一节吧</h2>\n      <p>新学员首次到店免费体验任意团课，现场办卡再享 95 折。</p>\n      <button class=\"btn primary\" type=\"button\" data-plan=\"免费体验课\">预约免费体验</button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n\n<footer class=\"site-footer\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <span>© 2026 静息瑜伽工作室</span>\n    <span>营业时间：周一至周日 07:00 – 22:00 · 咨询电话：400-000-0000</span>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n\n<div class=\"toast\" id=\"toast\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" hidden></div>\n\n<script>\n  (function () {\n    var toast = document.getElementById('toast');\n    var timer;\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-plan]').forEach(function (btn) {\n      btn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n        toast.textContent = '已选择「' + btn.dataset.plan + '」，请到前台或通过小程序完成预约。';\n        toast.hidden = false;\n        clearTimeout(timer);\n        timer = setTimeout(function () { toast.hidden = true; }, 3000);\n      });\n    });\n  })();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2296,"cache_read_inp